                  "Epigenetics/RmH3K9me3/H3K9_WT_MACS2_broad_peaks.bed")

# tBLASTn-identified Grem-LINE1 families.
# Primary  : de-novo-only summary (rnd-* families, 05c output filtered)
# Genome   : genome-level tBLASTn + GFF intersect for species missing from primary (05d)
# Fallback : blastn nucleotide hits (05b, 7 species)
